\begin_layout Standard
That's most likely because LyX is not sending Pandoc a file with the proper
 encoding.
 For a quick fix try: Document > Settings, go to the Language section, and
 under Encoding select Other: Unicode (utf8).
 Try exporting again.
 If that works now, then encoding was the problem.
 See the Troubleshooting section for a way to ensure that all your new LyX
 documents have the proper encoding setting.
 If you still get the warning message, see Troubleshooting below.
 
